# HIOXX React Patterns

## Components

- Functional components only
- Extract custom hooks for reusable logic
- Colocate step-specific components in `features/intake/components/`

## Styling

- Tailwind CSS with project palette: gold, lightBlue, green, red, dark
- Use `cn()` from `src/utils/cn.ts` for conditional classes
- Framer Motion for transitions (step changes, dropdowns, errors)
- Minimalist aesthetic: centered text, underline inputs, soft gradients

## UI Language

- All user-facing text in Spanish
- Error messages in Spanish via Zod schemas

## Example step component pattern

